olt-native)\"\nbb.edn:65:  probe:jolt-file\nbb.edn:66:  {:doc \"J4a: native/jolt-file gates, each in a child process: JVM-identical frame bytes (both hash algorithms), F2 s32BE prefixes, strict reads, injected short/EINTR/zero-progress/error transfers, corrupt-open byte identity, idempotent close, no fd or native-memory leak, a full collection during a 1 GiB :blocking pwrite, missing/wrong-layout wrapper refused before guest work, exported-symbol allowlist (needs bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:70:  probe:jolt-udp\nbb.edn:71:  {:doc \"J0b probe: raw nonblocking SOCK_DGRAM over jolt.ffi on macOS arm64 and Linux x86_64, printing the platform header first (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\"\nbb.edn:75:  probe:jolt-udp-failures\nbb.edn:76:  {:doc \"J7 regression probe: native UDP setup failure injection, exception/buffer cleanup, fatal error seam closure, and receive diagnostics (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\"\nbb.edn:80:  probe:jolt-tcp\nbb.edn:81:  {:doc \"J6d: the jolt TCP substrate and owner-thread pump (dao.stream.ws.tcp, dao.stream.ws.pump, driver sleep-fds!), one child jolt process per section: closure (no jolt.socket), address (literals/localhost, resolver trap), substrate (port 0, nonblocking accept/connect, EOF vs reset, gone-peer write survives), ordered (A3 short write, drain order, failure), fairness (A1 ii/iv), stdin (A1 i, held partial line), deadline (A2 seam), control (A3 event orders, A4 pong budget, D1 close slot), close (A5, D2, D3), listener (64 cap, lower-deadlines!, drained?); native memory and registry empty after close. Arguments select sections (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\"\nbb.edn:86:                               (println \"== probe:jolt-tcp section\" s)\nbb.edn:88:                                                \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt src/dev/jolt_tcp_probe.clj \\\"$1\\\"\"\nbb.edn:91:           (println \"probe:jolt-tcp exits\" (pr-str results))\nbb.edn:94:  probe:jolt-ws\nbb.edn:95:  {:doc \"J6e: the jolt WebSocket host adapter (dao.stream.ws.jolt, the yin.repl.host shadow, the jolt -main wiring), one child jolt process per section: closure (C1), handshake (C2), bind (C3), address (C4), io (C5), close (C6), shutdown (C7, the real owner loop), isolation (C8), driver (C9, deadline folding, a --headless --port child), fairness (C10); native memory and registries empty after close. Arguments select sections (needs bb bootstrap:jolt and bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:100:                               (println \"== probe:jolt-ws section\" s)\nbb.edn:102:                                                \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && exec \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt src/dev/jolt_ws_probe.clj \\\"$1\\\"\"\nbb.edn:105:           (println \"probe:jolt-ws exits\" (pr-str results))\nbb.edn:108:   workload-w:jolt\nbb.edn:109:   {:doc \"J6g: pre-registered Workload W, with an independent five-minute watchdog and ten-second sampler; one jolt worker serves two peers while stepping the REPL (needs bb bootstrap:jolt and bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:115:  build:jolt-native\nbb.edn:120:  test:jolt-host\nbb.edn:121:  {:doc \"J1: the dao.host oracle (conformance, bytes, float, text tests) under jolt -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-test through src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj; counts per namespace, nonzero exit on any failure, error or load failure (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\"\nbb.edn:124:                         \". build/tools/jolt-env.sh && \\\"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\\\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-test src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj dao.host.conformance-test dao.host.bytes-test dao.host.float-test dao.host.text-test\")))}\nbb.edn:130:  probe:jolt-j2\nbb.edn:131:  {:doc \"J2: staged load probe of the J2 load order under -M:jolt:jolt-test, one namespace per process (load-ok / first failing require / first unresolved symbol / first load-time error + the loaded-libs delta asserting dao.stream.transit absent); logs under build/j2-logs/probe (src/dev/jolt_j2_probe.clj; needs bb bootstrap:jol